#N canvas 60 60 760 620 12;
#X text 20 10 fx 3 Retrigger: loops the first stepdur/rate ms of the trigger. Read position r = wrap(e/slice)*slice*pitch \; delay = e - r. The e ramp runs the whole span so tied steps keep looping the same slice.;
